<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font style="" size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><br><div style=""><div style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hi&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!Contact.FirstName}</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoNormal">As discussed,
please <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/join.html?code=PFFREIGHT">click
here</a> to join the Qantas Business Rewards (QBR) program for free, a
saving of $89.50.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">Spend $600 using your Qantas Freight account between 1
February and 30 April 2020 to be eligible for a one off bonus of 5,000 QBR
points.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">Please note once you register an email will be sent to you
to confirm your details.&nbsp; Your registration is not complete until you
click on the link to activate your membership.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">For more information on the QBR program please <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/faqs.html">click here</a>.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">Please feel free to
contact me on the below details should you require assistance with sales
related enquiries.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">



















</p><p class="MsoNormal">Thank you<o:p></o:p></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div></div><div style=""><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Kind regards,</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">{!User.Name}</font></p><p style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">{!User.Title}</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;">Qantas Freight</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">A:&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">{!User.Address}</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone}</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: windowtext; text-decoration-line: none;">qantas.com</span></a><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp; | &nbsp;</span></span><a href="http://www.facebook.com/Qantas" style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: windowtext; text-decoration-line: none;">facebook.com/qantas</span></a><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;| &nbsp;</span></span><a href="http://www.twitter.com/qantas" style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: windowtext; text-decoration-line: none;">twitter @qantas</span></a><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;| &nbsp;</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 20px; color: windowtext; text-decoration-line: none;"><a href="http://www.youtube.com/qantas" style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;">youtube.com/qantas</a></span></p></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font style="" size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font><p style=""><img src="https://qantas--c.ap15.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FHvlL&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></p><p style="color: rgb(33, 33, 33); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;" align="center"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(33, 33, 33); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;" align="center"><br></p><div><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; color: black;"><br></span></div></div></div>]]></td>
